    {"issue": "The enumerated powers, in particular (x) to \"sell, auction, lease, rent, encumber or transfer any Trust Assets ... as the Trustee shall deem advisable\" and (dd) to retain professionals \"without approval of the Bankruptcy Court,\" cannot be squared with Section 3.3(e), which conditions any disposition of an asset worth $5,000 or more on Committee approval. The introductory \"subject to the foregoing\" does not name Section 3.3 as a limit.", "type": 2, "prob": 0.28}
